---
import Header from "../../../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../../../components/Footer.astro";
import Layout from "../../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../../../styles/legal.css";
import i18next, { t, changeLanguage } from "i18next";
import { Trans, HeadHrefLangs } from "astro-i18next/components";

changeLanguage("es-LAT");
---

<Layout
  title="WiiLink - WiiLink Accounts Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for WiiLink Accounts"
  image="/img/branding_bg.webp">
  <Header isGuide="display:none;" />

  <div class="legal">
    <section class="section">
      <h1>
        WiiLink Accounts Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <h3 class="update">
        Last updated: 04/04/2026
      </h3>
      <p class="title">
        Privacy policy for WiiLink Accounts
      </p>
      <section class="section">
        <l class="notice info fullwidth">
          Looking for our main Privacy Policy?
          Find it <a href="/privacy-policy">here</a>.
        </l></br></br>
        <p class="title">Privacy Policy</p>
        <p>
          The protection and confidentiality of personal data something WiiLink
          takes extremely seriously. We believe in protecting the information
          accessed in the most secure way possible. We also believe that being
          transparent on how we access your data leads to a bigger sense of
          trust with our users.
          <br /><br />
          Please take your time and read through this Privacy Policy to the best
          of your ability to learn how we access and store your data. You will be
          notified through our Discord server if this document changes.
          <br /><br />
          By using WiiLink Accounts, you consent to our practices stated in this
          document. If you do not consent, please do not use WiiLink Accounts.
          If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, do not
          hesitate to reach out to staff in our Discord server, or by emailing
          <a href="mailto:support@wiilink.ca">support@wiilink.ca</a>.
          <br />
          <br />
          <p class="title">What do we access?</p>
          When you create and use a WiiLink Account, the following personal data
          is stored by us:
          <ul style="list-style-type: square">
            <li>Account name</li>
            <li>Account username</li>
            <li>Email Address - Allows us to contact you if you request a password reset</li>
            <li>IP Address and User-Agent - Shown to you in the "Sessions" page
              in account settings, to review devices signed into your account</li>
          </ul>
          Additionally, our accounts platform uses GeoIP with your IP address for
          non-specific location information, which is used to help prevent abuse.
          <br /><br />
          If you link your account to a console, the following additional data is stored:
          <ul style="list-style-type: square">
            <li>Wii Number - Used to allow you to tell which console is which when multiple
              are linked to your account
            </li>
            <li>Console ID - Used to uniquely identify your console to check if you've
              enabled Domino's ordering
            </li>
            <li>Serial Number - Used to uniquely identify your console for Nintendo Channel
              data visible in WiiLink Checkout
            </li>
          </ul>

          This data is used as necessary for the account service. We do not sell
          or share data.
          <br />
          <br />
          You can exercise your right to be forgotten by deleting your account
          <a href="https://sso.riiconnect24.net/if/user/#/settings">here</a>.
          <br />
          <br />
          <p class="title">Children's Privacy</p>
          <section class="section">
            <div class="container">
              <div class="notification is-danger">
                <strong>Important!</strong><br />This service is not intended
                for children under the age of 13.
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
          <p>
            This service is not intended for children under the age of 13. If
            you are under the age of 13, please exit this website and do not
            access this service. WiiLink does not knowingly collect data from
            children under the age of 13.
          </p>

          <p class="title">Changes to this Privacy Policy</p>
          <p>
            It is our policy to inform the consumers to any changes to this
            privacy policy. If there is a change, you will be notified through
            our Discord server. The revision date of the privacy
            policy is at the top and/or bottom of the page.
          </p>
        </p>
        <br><br>
        <p class="title">
            Last Modified
        </p>
        <p>
            Saturday, April 4th, 2026
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
